<title>UK: LIFFE white sugar turnover a record on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>LIFFE white sugar turnover a record on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The daily turnover on the LIFFE white sugar contract was an all time record high of 7,989 lots on Wednesday, an Exchange official said.</p>
<p>It surpassed the previous record of 7,215 lots set in April 1995.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
